WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:01,890
I don’t know about Commander Wei

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:05,090
What do you want with me, a mediocre dead ball?

3
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:06,650
Unremarkable

4
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,130
Just two dead ball missions

5
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:09,730
Can kill nearly fifty people

6
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:10,970
including one

7
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,610
The leader of the Northern Barbarian Hundreds of Cavalry

8
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:14,730
I don't think this is ordinary.

9
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:17,490
If you have anything to do, just tell me

10
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:20,530
Now that everyone is here

11
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,010
Then Wei will say it directly.

12
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,650
Let a few people come here today

13
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:26,250
I want to invite a few people to join forces.

14
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:28,370
Help our mighty camp solve some things

15
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:29,730
What a joke

16
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,970
Let me, Shen San, help your court

17
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:33,770
I think you want your butt teeth

18
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,450
I'll put my words here for you

19
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,130
I will die here today

20
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:44,720
I, Shen San, will never help your court officials, so forget it.

21
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,140
I originally wanted you to do something for me

22
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,980
I will return your household registration afterwards

23
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,140
set you free

24
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:53,480
not free

25
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:54,980
What you said is true

26
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,500
Can you give me household registration?

27
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:57,860
Give me my freedom

28
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,820
Didn’t you say you wouldn’t help the court?

29
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,180
What does it mean to help the court?

30
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:03,780
I was spontaneously willing to help others, didn’t you say that again?

31
00:01:03,780 --> 00:01:05,500
Will you change your mind even if you die?

32
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:07,020
The problem is I'm not dead yet

33
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,620
what i said is true

34
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:10,460
Then you agreed

35
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:12,180
Agree Agree
